# tp4/next-2 window: this is tp4-kvread-next-jobs/Q3-kvread-cross-prefix-audit re-pointed at the integrated image tp4-next2-1 (B0 of this pack, built from the tp4/next-2 head = tp4/octo-2 + tp4/prod-fixes); where the text below
# says tp4/prod-fixes or the window branch read tp4/next-2, and the image tag placeholder is tp4-next2-1 (sed -i 's/tp4-next2-1/<tag>/' *.env). ORDER.txt of this pack has the order and the minutes.
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the region-read qualification pack (tp4-kvread-next-jobs, docs/prefix-audit-cost.md; scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of the window branch and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time.
# The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from this branch by its author. ORDER.txt has the order, the stop rules, the read rules and the cost.
# C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-next2-1 is a PLACEHOLDER for the tag B0 builds from the pushed branch head (sed -i 's/tp4-next2-1/<tag>/' *.env).
# Q3 (THE CROSS CHECK of the PREFIX audit, the read-qualify plan of the prefix gate): the short exactness chain (c2_prefix_gate.py --plan read-qualify, one arm, the profile audited by the gate with QWEN_PREFIX_AUDIT=1 and
# QWEN_PREFIX_AUDIT_READ=cross): the first audited step also reads whole caches and compares byte for byte (one whole-pool read, about 8 minutes at the production pool), every later step is the region read alone. The gate
# refuses the plan before any container boots when the image has no ttnn.qwen_read_blocks (the anchor probe), and judges '[PREFIX-AUDIT-CROSS] tensors= mismatched=' (a mismatch is a FAIL, an absent line NOT_EXERCISED).
# READ: the plan verdict PASS with the cross line at mismatched=0 and no fallback, the '[PREFIX-AUDIT-COST]' line of every step saying mode=region (the first mode=region with the cross comparison), and the program count unchanged
# across every audited step. Duration (estimate): 75 minutes. Stop rule: FAIL or NOT_EXERCISED stops the pack's audited jobs.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset prefix
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-next2-1
C2_PREFIX_PLAN=read-qualify
C2_PREFIX_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-audit
C2_PREFIX_BASELINE=none
C2_BOX_MINUTES=75
